  "name": "Nudge (Su)",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "subType": "classFeat",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> —</p><p>As a free action, you can expend MGP to adjust the value of any d6 or d8 you roll by +1 or –1. Decreasing a rolled 1 increases it to the die's maximum value, while increasing a maximum rolled value reduces it to 1. Each die can only be adjusted by this gambit once per roll. This gambit cannot be used when rolling for hit points. The amount of MGP expended is equal to 2 per the number of dice adjusted.</p>",
